// Units: km, kg, m/s^2, km/s, hours (negative: retrograde), days, au, deg, kPa, K. Conversions:
// K = C + 273.15; 1 bar = 100 kPa; 1 au = 149 597 870.7 km (IAU 2012 B2). mean_radius_km: the
// sheet's volumetric mean, or (a b c)^(1/3) of the axes it gives. sidereal_rotation_h of a moon the
// sheet marks synchronous without a number: its orbital period x 24. mean_temp_k: the fact tables'
// "Mean Temperature" (giant planets at 1 bar; the Sun: effective temperature). None: not on the sheets
// (no surface pressure for giants or exospheres; Iapetus's two-faced albedo 0.05 / 0.5; Hyperion's
// chaotic rotation). moons: this body's moons that have an entry here; all moons: sat_elements.ron.
